[{:db/id "q-123292/selection/83c337c9e2e9a5e5dc57c764aff6c9ccef4bafb6f732a2225d16a48eb962774d" :answer/id #uuid "8abe4085-4103-5fb4-b936-92da9a38bf1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{2}+5,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292/selection/46e89f817a5e619d7cfb26cb98e77ebeb64af70d0ca4e8b5aa3a5cc1bd212513" :answer/id #uuid "3a82c268-1c6a-5d2e-9816-33664201353a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292/selection/cbef05226c7d15e8b844ae10934b5689df811893fbaf4f620db7c6e93145d3e0" :answer/id #uuid "4f2abbd6-0067-5ac9-8fb9-0f4954aaef26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292/selection/364bb9b83d166f6ff99b68e36f5c461d4d526ac7afc6f83ac74911a7287ea911" :answer/id #uuid "7544c2eb-b2e2-54fb-aa8a-753c35a20a8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292/selection/1a60e5de710e5c160808a7009d5e0fa133d5a44d26e20970a7bd66d0bd0c6565" :answer/id #uuid "975930d5-fd18-51c1-8f45-7c2aa09aa645" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{5t},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f6c4e7a6-d9ee-51ba-90db-917bd21236a8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123292/selection/cbef05226c7d15e8b844ae10934b5689df811893fbaf4f620db7c6e93145d3e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-123292/selection/83c337c9e2e9a5e5dc57c764aff6c9ccef4bafb6f732a2225d16a48eb962774d" "q-123292/selection/46e89f817a5e619d7cfb26cb98e77ebeb64af70d0ca4e8b5aa3a5cc1bd212513" "q-123292/selection/cbef05226c7d15e8b844ae10934b5689df811893fbaf4f620db7c6e93145d3e0" "q-123292/selection/364bb9b83d166f6ff99b68e36f5c461d4d526ac7afc6f83ac74911a7287ea911" "q-123292/selection/1a60e5de710e5c160808a7009d5e0fa133d5a44d26e20970a7bd66d0bd0c6565"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123292" :question/id #uuid "811bbc59-9fc3-5b4b-bd9e-2e09752150a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-123292" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩$, then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int ({e}^{2t}+5)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123292/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9688df89-056e-59d7-869e-9841715b2aea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123292"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection/ccb21a46c074d1e16345c7e13585929fa31a0bf0e8b053e9e16f344539e87ebe" :answer/id #uuid "263a796b-776f-5aa0-8101-96956a88b3d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{4}-t,{e}^{2t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection/e8d72b512375832fd80a71862bf2054b8792177b55a7f471a7c17f12ed0690bf" :answer/id #uuid "c929992e-bce0-5bfa-9b7e-4792fae8273f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{t}^{2}-t,2{e}^{2t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection/df1626659f5d347a2bad6381c7b3ccf5ba6c9c417f1ebb3cae53996607f87783" :answer/id #uuid "da83afee-1780-5d2e-95fa-1ae9f5c5bf2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection/2f079a08e7d39b717d4a51d6d146bdd0abb3a200bb9c33e7373f6066e756459f" :answer/id #uuid "d6ac72b4-fc55-5c24-91a0-7e9995c206ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection/ccf9f582df1e3904199c9c589e7eb0c28c5e47edae1fbc843317187bdd23c92b" :answer/id #uuid "cae03307-c9b3-580b-8c85-34381a8232b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3{t}^{4}-2t,\\,\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d43fa657-4567-5305-a1a7-79ff5d4c7dc3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99253/selection/df1626659f5d347a2bad6381c7b3ccf5ba6c9c417f1ebb3cae53996607f87783" :answer-field/choices ["q-99253/selection/ccb21a46c074d1e16345c7e13585929fa31a0bf0e8b053e9e16f344539e87ebe" "q-99253/selection/e8d72b512375832fd80a71862bf2054b8792177b55a7f471a7c17f12ed0690bf" "q-99253/selection/df1626659f5d347a2bad6381c7b3ccf5ba6c9c417f1ebb3cae53996607f87783" "q-99253/selection/2f079a08e7d39b717d4a51d6d146bdd0abb3a200bb9c33e7373f6066e756459f" "q-99253/selection/ccf9f582df1e3904199c9c589e7eb0c28c5e47edae1fbc843317187bdd23c92b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99253" :question/id #uuid "b610ae44-a882-5221-be1d-5cbe96ffd50a" :question/math-academy-id "q-99253" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}-1)\\,\\text{d}t,2\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t+{c}_{1},\\,2{e}^{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-99253/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9688df89-056e-59d7-869e-9841715b2aea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99253"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection/214dc32590a6a2bacc60b97cd5975c361d4eab33adb8b1d5657dfea0d70bad7a" :answer/id #uuid "06c9e59c-e5b1-5b66-8dff-8168e82f57e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{2}-4t,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection/526ffd356052bd7893e1afc175d3ad81cbc98ce2783aff73a614aafbc495a32d" :answer/id #uuid "da6eab72-cc08-5c30-8d47-56e79e134a32" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection/d156d9b33137630a9eda1bf3baaedf83f93e5f78b5257896584ed7bbb53d240f" :answer/id #uuid "07760852-7e75-5d60-b33c-97f4b182b3b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2{t}^{4}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection/42a1b7ba9a8ea656c8eddd797ccf2c3c7f42a41f0b9fc86b5abc83f910a4a7bc" :answer/id #uuid "5cf1f19e-c81a-5fbe-a98b-1aac77e7abce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨t+4,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection/d64b0b3f937be67868a730c2ca058fb3faa2e13c2ca8de9f835b152ea93ae892" :answer/id #uuid "7d279be7-88e7-5105-b1c9-f2cc00d0a788" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{4}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e341e2a8-13ea-5904-bea2-edfe43b7c86c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123294/selection/526ffd356052bd7893e1afc175d3ad81cbc98ce2783aff73a614aafbc495a32d" :answer-field/choices ["q-123294/selection/214dc32590a6a2bacc60b97cd5975c361d4eab33adb8b1d5657dfea0d70bad7a" "q-123294/selection/526ffd356052bd7893e1afc175d3ad81cbc98ce2783aff73a614aafbc495a32d" "q-123294/selection/d156d9b33137630a9eda1bf3baaedf83f93e5f78b5257896584ed7bbb53d240f" "q-123294/selection/42a1b7ba9a8ea656c8eddd797ccf2c3c7f42a41f0b9fc86b5abc83f910a4a7bc" "q-123294/selection/d64b0b3f937be67868a730c2ca058fb3faa2e13c2ca8de9f835b152ea93ae892"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123294" :question/id #uuid "cbfe4f27-7d39-5346-b6c3-d28ca1cafdae" :question/math-academy-id "q-123294" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}+2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{t}{4}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123294/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9688df89-056e-59d7-869e-9841715b2aea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123294"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99260/selection/3db8a50b606a955c31717d8488c3d9789dc1664aeb5400a1e582416b66d00aa0" :answer/id #uuid "ca3a1815-9872-5c8c-9bf9-9f225cb9ebd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99260/selection/eebf4597ceab5fa862b7d456cf25a6c617a5c054ebca856bc907a36c91af8