)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {sec}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-99260/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9688df89-056e-59d7-869e-9841715b2aea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99260"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection/010f0e5ab78af2b5609000cc5845128b6222be6103728f65a01a7474c052371a" :answer/id #uuid "a1931dd8-7454-5ae4-9941-da525a073842" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection/f57dee94b6bd2a77ca8b01bf6672ec0f92d13a1ae205bc8f7536e42e24d719d9" :answer/id #uuid "e457e4a2-9f23-5f2c-94f5-ea4af362203d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,-\\frac{2}{{t}^{2}}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection/0e38d6456ff6a02f0214a0e39c0b032bc5c4663e780df8b4c074039b9e35e1f5" :answer/id #uuid "a8202694-f1ec-5e9d-9738-e970c6ae9033" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection/2514a0ae3f4d0c26c83ac403fd5f8d2dc6fca2889a9aee4751e8239fa971114b" :answer/id #uuid "88948b16-ddb8-5649-8a96-794616ece5ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,-2{t}^{3}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection/1778672405e6691312d0d5b60a81b87dd4b650b00b90d440ab45109fdf90bdc3" :answer/id #uuid "1141079a-19aa-5fdd-9c7c-f2d6ad101b44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,{t}^{2}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a86665ce-7f9a-5213-890c-a18c738dc168" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99352/selection/0e38d6456ff6a02f0214a0e39c0b032bc5c4663e780df8b4c074039b9e35e1f5" :answer-field/choices ["q-99352/selection/010f0e5ab78af2b5609000cc5845128b6222be6103728f65a01a7474c052371a" "q-99352/selection/f57dee94b6bd2a77ca8b01bf6672ec0f92d13a1ae205bc8f7536e42e24d719d9" "q-99352/selection/0e38d6456ff6a02f0214a0e39c0b032bc5c4663e780df8b4c074039b9e35e1f5" "q-99352/selection/2514a0ae3f4d0c26c83ac403fd5f8d2dc6fca2889a9aee4751e8239fa971114b" "q-99352/selection/1778672405e6691312d0d5b60a81b87dd4b650b00b90d440ab45109fdf90bdc3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99352" :question/id #uuid "d413689c-9799-50bd-948a-f60e39c1c13a" :question/math-academy-id "q-99352" :question/problem "Find $\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},-\\frac{2}{{t}^{3}}⟩\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int -\\frac{2}{{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t}+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-99352/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "53fca396-4ade-5180-9c9b-a73f24f5b5b8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99352"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-poi