}⟩\\text{d}t=$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{9}⟨4-2t,\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{4}^{9}4-2t\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{4}^{9}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(4t-{t}^{2})\\,\\,{|}_{4}^{9},\\,2\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{4}^{9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-45-0,\\,6-4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-45,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123456/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123456"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-349116/field-1/65c6f9fb0af02e4612ffd1b4c3102888e192f0b68ee31c1a33c84939ec166d56" :answer/id #uuid "6ea0ccf0-0354-5ca9-b0ac-314907fd05fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "708" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349116/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8645c0f0-97a6-5263-91ce-74241ccd029e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349116/field-1/65c6f9fb0af02e4612ffd1b4c3102888e192f0b68ee31c1a33c84939ec166d56" :answer-field/choices ["q-349116/field-1/65c6f9fb0af02e4612ffd1b4c3102888e192f0b68ee31c1a33c84939ec166d56"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349116/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "a4724bbc-8258-5235-bb67-e3cb4e763e3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349116/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b21e01e-75d3-510d-a271-dfe9d302f54c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349116/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-349116/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349116" :question/id #uuid "11c7606c-3688-541f-b65a-5626fa61655b" :question/math-academy-id "q-349116" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{4}^{16}(6t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{4}^{16}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int (6t-1)\\,\\text{d}t=3{t}^{2}-t.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t=\\sqrt{t}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(3{t}^{2}-t){|}_{4}^{16},\\,(\\sqrt{t}){|}_{4}^{16}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(3\\cdot {16}^{2}-16)-(3\\cdot {4}^{2}-4),\\,4-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(768-16)-(48-4),\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨752-44,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨708,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨708,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-349116/field-1" "q-349116/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-349116"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-349112/field-1/a0d0bc96d7f89f9928f267c3f4944055628442fbc9faa554cbf6c6e7f1c15f49" :answer/id #uuid "306b7cd2-f1e7-5242-ae31-dc2c614c5e14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\ln(3)-\\ln(2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349112/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b319d812-12ae-58e4-bcfd-41e0361de7f5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349112/field-1/a0d0bc96d7f89f9928f267c3f4944055628442fbc9faa554cbf6c6e7f1c15f49" :answer-field/choices ["q-349112/field-1/a0d0bc96d7f89f9928f267c3f4944055628442fbc9faa554cbf6c6e7f1c15f49"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349112/field-2/df4ef3a75f6d71027299791921d9536d50890079e16123ff435f8ed8ac6150b0" :answer/id #uuid "faa90b47-4de6-5f6e-8248-a02d7ab51a9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349112/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "bf928a0c-de75-55af-a690-4a47cade017b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349112/field-2/df4ef3a75f6d71027299791921d9536d50890079e16123ff435f8ed8ac6150b0" :answer-field/choices ["q-349112/field-2/df4ef3a75f6d71027299791921d9536d50890079e16123ff435f8ed8ac6150b0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349112" :question/id #uuid "784dba63-554b-55cc-8825-7f46d8c83131" :question/math-academy-id "q-349112" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, let $u=3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t$, so $\\text{d}u={csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int -2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2),\\,2\\,(0-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-349112/field-1" "q-349112/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-349112"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183/field-1/221494d4209f3500553a0760c55a4f69c71a7ba0ed2d55621c94c46e8d2261b7" :answer/id #uuid "083d2621-f147-5cf1-b25f-dc2aa90934fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sqrt{t}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183/field-1/0bbf98f45c1d4d84dec1b2eecfdf6d085922f95a1ac67e34bf957e85a08ebed7" :answer/id #uuid "97567933-d63f-59fe-ad8e-dcd05483abb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sqrt{t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "5dafb2dd-b14b-58c8-a1f6-e72b1e4d55e1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349183/field-1/221494d4209f3500553a0760c55a4f69c71a7ba0ed2d55621c94c46e8d2261b7" :answer-field/choices ["q-349183/field-1/221494d4209f3500553a0760c55a4f69c71a7ba0ed2d55621c94c46e8d2261b7" "q-349183/field-1/0bbf98f45c1d4d84dec1b2eecfdf6d085922f95a1ac67e34bf957e85a08ebed7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183/field-2/3f4d5f1e332b48b8fd035e45da0c3e3287b2836d8bce49aaacb3bd098e80e454" :answer/id #uuid "f61c2eed-5fb3-5eb4-a54a-ef6f17075b76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2e^{-2t}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "7031045f-74ad-56d7-96cb-961ea22211a2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349183/field-2/3f4d5f1e332b48b8fd035e45da0c3e3287b2836d8bce49aaacb3bd098e80e454" :answer-field/choices ["q-349183/field-2/3f4d5f1e332b48b8fd035e45da0c3e3287b2836d8bce49aaacb3bd098e80e454"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349183" :question/id #uuid "f3d00973-ef37-5914-9b0b-74027ff07272" :question/math-academy-id "q-349183" :question/problem "Find $F(t)$ given that \n\n$$\n{F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\n$$\n\n and $F(1)=⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩.$\n\n$F(t)=⟨${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 4{e}^{-2t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6\\sqrt{t}+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2t}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨6\\sqrt{1}+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩ \\\\ ⟨6+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=5$ and ${c}_{2}=3.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨6\\sqrt{t}+5,\\,-2{e}^{-2t}+3⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-349183/field-1" "q-349183/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-349183"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection/11f5aad94b7b558d5a1d977c095800655a69bb64428fe620c4630c85f413126c" :answer/id #uuid "df8955f2-9a32-5b17-8bff-248f3d27d7ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection/b8e9b918e518b4b030e699c648f425ecc074ac03a47ab83d6595d848c8cc1a16" :answer/id #uuid "59963ef5-5a1f-5633-ac55-771559b01186" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}+1,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection/379fbbef0dc0dd2ea419b6b3ef956301b25377624da7be72330f4f090252e9da" :answer/id #uuid "9c490178-18aa-5391-ad88-0680d15ee0d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1-t|,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection/5b9281ac8048e2901db6c1d33679f765f0841e98380edec1c31898b4b4945c3e" :answer/id #uuid "76c102f6-6195-5616-9b74-041dff9d66d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection/13ba45d0bc3c7f7868a4b2748739a7f6750414f33bcb99c9733fcd4d2e9784d0" :answer/id #uuid "97b4223c-7d99-53b6-b68c-8d022f820fcc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0fab8a1c-c3a8-5595-ba42-a9a4539ebbe1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99546/selection/11f5aad94b7b558d5a1d977c095800655a69bb64428fe620c4630c85f413126c" :answer-field/choices ["q-99546/selection/11f5aad94b7b558d5a1d977c095800655a69bb64428fe620c4630c85f413126c" "q-99546/selection/b8e9b918e518b4b030e699c648f425ecc074ac03a47ab83d6595d848c8cc1a16" "q-99546/selection/379fbbef0dc0dd2ea419b6b3ef956301b25377624da7be72330f4f090252e9da" "q-99546/selection/5b9281ac8048e2901db6c1d33679f765f0841e98380edec1c31898b4b4945c3e" "q-99546/selection/13ba45d0bc3c7f7868a4b2748739a7f6750414f33bcb99c9733fcd4d2e9784d0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99546" :question/id #uuid "e321419c-a366-5737-8cc6-0eb09e45ddb0" :question/math-academy-id "q-99546" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩$ and $F(1)=⟨-1,\\,2⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{1}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨-1,\\,2⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-1,\\,2⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-1,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=-1$ and ${c}_{2}=1.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-99546/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99546"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
